@startuml
state "已申请(APPLIED)" as applied
state "已取消(CANCELLED)" as cancelled
state "已过期(EXPIRED)" as expired
state "借阅中(BORROWED)" as borrowed
state "已逾期(OVERDUE)" as overdue
state "已归还(RETURNED)" as returned
state "已丢失(LOST)" as lost

[*] --> applied
applied --> cancelled : 用户取消
applied --> expired : 超时未取书
applied --> borrowed : 管理员确认借出
borrowed --> overdue : 超过应还日期
borrowed --> returned : 按时归还
borrowed --> lost : 图书丢失
overdue --> returned : 归还图书
overdue --> lost : 图书丢失

note bottom of expired : 系统自动处理\n扣除10信用分
note bottom of overdue : 系统自动检测\n扣除20信用分
note bottom of lost : 管理员手动标记\n扣除40信用分
note bottom of returned : 按时归还可获得\n5信用分奖励
@enduml